# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Minimization in a Python simulation on the CPU (D202), scenario stalled of
# Inputs/python_minimize.py: the end at a step shrunk below the floor
# (D[minimize-zero-step]), against `mdir run`.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir %t stalled | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: CPU Double, cutoff: mdir run and the simulation stop at step
# CHECK: minimization stalled passed
